                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": " For a first-order reaction, the rate constant "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "k"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " is equal to the negative of the slope of the graph of ln(concentration) vs. time. The graph of 1/[C"
